{"id":"ft7f4xrfwd9ip9sek8kaglvxr","title":"第一届现代数学物理学国际会议 (ICMMP 2026) 圆满落幕！","originalTitle":null,"summary":"2026年10月30日至11月3日，第一届现代数学物理学国际会议 (ICMMP 2026) 在浙江大学成功举办，吸引了来自不同国家和地区的约140位专家学者及青年研究人员。会议围绕量子场论、可积模型、量子信息、原子分子与光物理、非线性动力学与计算物理等方向展开交流。会议闭幕时公布了五项最佳海报奖，并宣布下一届ICMMP将于中国西安举行。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3516770&do=blog&id=1560888"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:45:51.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:13:34.914Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:13:34.914Z","category":null,"tags":["会议与顶会"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}